  "body": "When uploading a too large file, synapse responds with a 413 (OK) but with errcode M_UNKNOWN. According to the [spec](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/latest#post-matrix-media-r0-upload), it should be \"M_TOO_LARGE\"\r\n\r\nReceived responseCode: 413\r\nReceived responseBody:\r\n`{\"errcode\":\"M_UNKNOWN\",\"error\":\"Upload request body is too large\"}`\r\n\r\n",
